            "text_6CBVUD": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Bring your vision to life with custom-designed jewelry from Wedding Day Diamonds. Whether you're in Richfield, Eden Prairie, Maple Grove, or anywhere in Minnesota, our expert jewelers work with you to create one-of-a-kind pieces that reflect your story and style. From custom engagement rings and wedding bands to unique pendants and heirloom redesigns, we turn your ideas into timeless treasures.</p><p>Our process is collaborative and precise, using the latest technology and the finest materials. You'll see your design come to life through sketches, 3D modeling, and expert craftsmanship. Whether you're starting from scratch or updating a sentimental piece, we guide you every step of the way to ensure your custom jewelry exceeds expectations.</p><p>Visit any of our Minnesota showrooms and let us help you create something truly unforgettable.</p>",
