                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jDbKL3": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, Wedding Day Diamonds offers customization options. You can work with our team to create a unique engagement ring that matches your vision, whether it's adjusting the setting, choosing different diamonds and gemstones, or personalizing the band.</p>",
